15 0 obj
<< /A 45 0 R /Alt (Three-panel charts show wind speed, swell, and sea significant height in the North Indian Ocean during June to August \(JJA\) and December to February \(DJF\). Wind speed \(left\) is highest in JJA with warm colors. Swell significant height \(middle\) highlights central ocean areas with warm colors in both periods. Sea significant height \(right\) shows lower values in blue and green shades. Arrows indicate wind direction, with varying intensities.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 46 0 R /Alt <> /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 34 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
